    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im writing this paper for my international relations class about whether economic sanctions actually work. like, are they actually a real way to help push for democracy in certain countries, or is it honestly just a way for big powerful nations to bully smaller ones? i'm having trouble seeing which side is more 'right' so i wanted to get your take on the debate.",
